  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When you block someone the intended result is that that person cannot see or interact with you.\n\nThis is not the case with the website when you block someone.\nBlocked users can still send you friend requests even if you have them blocked.\n\nThis does not work in-game, so it is expected that the same would apply to the website.\n\nVideo: https://youtu.be/pK3clWrmIVk\n\nSteps;\n- Block user (website or in-game)\n- Have that user send a friend request via the website\n- Friend request will now show up for you.",
